WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:08.764
An astronaut in blue gloves harvests green leafy plants from a chamber, then uses scissors to cut a red pepper on a dark panel.

2
00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:36.616
Astronauts in blue shirts float in a cluttered module, perform synchronized handshake chains, clasp hands while others watch, a woman in green joins a hand circle, they laugh and disperse.
